(149, 1, '2016-07-28 18:02:21', '2016-07-28 14:02:21', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6\" style=\"float: right; margin-left: 20px;\" src=\"http://aliveliyev.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/IMG_0612-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_0612\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />Ali S. Veliyev was born in Baku, Azerbaijan on 4 February 1993.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">He studied at the secondary school №134 at Baku, Azerbaijan.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In 2010</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">He graduated from the faculty of Applied Mathematics in Moscow State University (Baku branch) and awarded a bachelor degree in 2014, master degree in 2016. Both of them were completed with honours.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">During his studies he took part in ACM ICPC, Open Caucasus Championship and other programming contests and scientific conferences. Also he has his own channel on Youtube where he posts educational materials of olympic programming.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In 2013 Ali opened his first startup project <a href=\"http://studyprog.com\">Studyprog</a>.</p>', 'Biography', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2-autosave-v1', '', '', '2016-07-28 18:02:21', '2016-07-28 14:02:21', '', 2, 'http://aliveliyev.com/2016/07/05/2-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
