(159, 1, '2016-07-05 20:28:32', '2016-07-05 19:28:32', 'Ali S. Veliyev is the author and co-author of the following scientific papers:\n<ol>\n 	<li>Veliyev A. S., Sidorenko V. N. Economic-mathematical modeling of the software market. (Thesis on scientific conference Lomonosov 2012 Azerbaijan regional).</li>\n 	<li>Veliyev A. S., Grigoriev I. S. Parameter continuation method and numerical solution of the Cauchy problem. (Thesis on scientific conference Lomonosov 2013 Azerbaijan regional).</li>\n 	<li>Veliyev A. S., Grigoriev I. S. Optimizing satellite placement on geostationary orbit. (Thesis on scientific conference Lomonosov 2014 Azerbaijan regional).</li>\n 	<li>Veliyev A. S., Proskuriakov A. I., Grigoriev I. S. Expanded testing system. (Thesis on scientific conference Lomonosov 2014 Azerbaijan regional).</li>\n 	<li>Veliyev A. S., Grigoriev I. S. Optimizing satellite placement on geostationary orbit. Diploma work. 2014.</li>\n 	<li>Rzaev R., Shikhalieva G., Aghamaliev M., Veliyev A. Time series modeling based on fuzzy data analysis // Fuzzy systems and soft computing. 2014. P. 9, №1. P. 39-86.</li>\n 	<li>Veliyev A. S., Grigoriev I. S. Optimizing satellite placement on geostationary orbit. (Thesis on scientific conference Lomonosov 2015 Azerbaijan regional).</li>\n 	<li>Veliyev A. S. CMS Framework on PHP with REST technology: safe and UX. (Thesis on scientific conference Lomonosov 2016 Azerbaijan regional).</li>\n 	<li>Veliyev A. S., Grigoriev I. S. Optimizing satellite placement on geostationary orbit. Master the</li>\n</ol>', 'Science', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '78-autosave-v1', '', '', '2016-07-05 20:28:32', '2016-07-05 19:28:32', '', 78, 'http://aliveliyev.com/2016/07/05/78-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
